# fixtures/p6/objects6.pdf (sha ca0a5988…2ab8) and fixtures/p6/direct3.pdf (sha e3ae5a43…7466), Letter, drive zoom fit-width;
# y-down page pt (y_down = 792 - y_up; view = [x0, 792-y1, x1, 792-y0]). objects6 page 0 centres (p6-unit6-fixture.md):
# Im1 (122,167) [72,142,172,192] · Im2 (425,92) [400,42,450,142] · Im3 (250,167) [200,142,300,192] · Im4 (102,372) vis [72,352,132,392] full [72,342,172,392]
# Fm1 band (74,600) / interior empty (200,600) [72,492,372,692] · Im5 (325,647) [300,622,350,672] · "Over" (115,537) · empty (500,450).
# expect is exact (main.ts matches): revision is absolute (every mutate, undo and redo adds 1). Expects pin revision, dirty, content.edited and
# direct.{active,selection,menu,crop} only; every view/full/orient is checked in tests/p6-drive7.test.mjs via all() (content.objects is exact-length).
# `menu` carries `contents`; every `handle` carries page,x,y (the object's centre; for a group, the group box's handle point).
{"cmd":"open","path":"fixtures/p6/objects6.pdf","expect":{"doc":{"name":"objects6.pdf","pageCount":2},"dirty":false,"revision":0}}
{"cmd":"mode","contents":{"mode":"edit","tool":"add-text"},"expect":{"mode":"edit","direct":{"mode":"edit","objects":6,"active":null,"selection":[],"menu":null,"crop":null}}}
